# Live project: sessions picker with real TODAY history

Output out/02-sessions-picker.mp4
Output out/02-sessions-picker.gif

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 2560
Set Height 1600
Set Padding 10
Set Margin 0
Set TypingSpeed 0ms
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Framerate 24
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Hide
Type "./bin/run-spur-tui-live.sh"
Enter
Show
Wait+Screen@25s /Lineage/
Sleep 1s
Hide
Type "s"
Show
Wait+Screen@15s /Sessions/
Sleep 3s
